1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1964217206, "strokeColor": "#495057", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "etats.jpg (recadr\u00e9, 60 %) : survol de l'image, du titre et du cr\u00e9ateur", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2061720320, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nft-1a-tab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 75480, "y": 210, "width": 1000, "height": 600, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kg", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 233483722, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 536354646}, {"id": "nft-1a-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 75504, "y": 230, "width": 165, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kh", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1731401131, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1225347711, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nft-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 75504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 318.75, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0ki", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Blue 950 (main BG).\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 350 \u00d7 596 centr\u00e9e (x 545, y 152), rayon 15, Blue 900, grande ombre\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0sombre et douce.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Image 302 \u00d7 302 (fichier 604 \u00d7 604, \u00e9cran 2\u00d7), rayon 8, marge de 24.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Equilibrium #3429 \u00bb 22 px 600 blanc, encre \u00e0 30 sous l'image.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe 18 px 300 Blue 500, 2 lignes de 26 px.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4ne Ethereum 11 \u00d7 18 + \u00ab 0.041 ETH \u00bb 16 px 600 Cyan 400 ; \u00e0 droite,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ic\u00f4ne horloge 17 \u00d7 17 + \u00ab 3 days left \u00bb 16 px 400 Blue 500.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trait 1 px Blue 800 (y 666), 24 sous la ligne du prix.\n6\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Avatar rond 33 px, fin contour blanc ; \u00ab Creation of \u00bb 16 px 300 Blue 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0+ \u00ab Jules Wyvern \u00bb 16 px 400 blanc ; 32 en bas.\n\nSurvols (etats.jpg) : image voil\u00e9e de Cyan 400 (\u2248 50 %) avec l'\u0153il\nicon-view.svg 48 px au centre ; titre et nom du cr\u00e9ateur en Cyan 400.\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titre 22 \u00b7 texte 18 \u00b7 prix, jours, cr\u00e9ateur 16 (\u2264 3 %).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 446190211, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Blue 950 (main BG).\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 350 \u00d7 596 centr\u00e9e (x 545, y 152), rayon 15, Blue 900, grande ombre\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0sombre et douce.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Image 302 \u00d7 302 (fichier 604 \u00d7 604, \u00e9cran 2\u00d7), rayon 8, marge de 24.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Equilibrium #3429 \u00bb 22 px 600 blanc, encre \u00e0 30 sous l'image.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe 18 px 300 Blue 500, 2 lignes de 26 px.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4ne Ethereum 11 \u00d7 18 + \u00ab 0.041 ETH \u00bb 16 px 600 Cyan 400 ; \u00e0 droite,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ic\u00f4ne horloge 17 \u00d7 17 + \u00ab 3 days left \u00bb 16 px 400 Blue 500.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trait 1 px Blue 800 (y 666), 24 sous la ligne du prix.\n6\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Avatar rond 33 px, fin contour blanc ; \u00ab Creation of \u00bb 16 px 300 Blue 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0+ \u00ab Jules Wyvern \u00bb 16 px 400 blanc ; 32 en bas.\n\nSurvols (etats.jpg) : image voil\u00e9e de Cyan 400 (\u2248 50 %) avec l'\u0153il\nicon-view.svg 48 px au centre ; titre et nom du cr\u00e9ateur en Cyan 400.\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titre 22 \u00b7 texte 18 \u00b7 prix, jours, cr\u00e9ateur 16 (\u2264 3 %).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2042792029, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nft-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 74000, "y": 1180, "width": 374, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kj", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 667 (mobile.jpg)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1055546928, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 667 (mobile.jpg)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 534222732, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nft-img-m-cadre", "type": "rectangle", "x": 74000, "y": 1220, "width": 375, "height": 667, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kk", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1949410769, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793895229960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 211346291}, {"id": "nft-1b-card", "type": "rectangle", "x": 74024, "y": 1282, "width": 328, "height": 545, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "bound